WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.390
<i>Episode 12</i>

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:55.770
Greetings, Your Highness.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:57.140
At ease.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.750
Please come to the Hall of
 Esteemed Virtue, Highness.

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:01.890
This is an order from the Prince.

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:05.640
Hall of Esteemed Virtue? What's that?

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:10.570
The Hall of Esteemed Virtue is the 
residence of Prince Ye, Your Highness.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.270
<i><i>What the hell does Prince Ye-diot want now?</i></i>

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:15.670
You'd better go.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:16.270
Excuse me?

00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:18.670
You might manage to hide from him today, 
but you can't hide forever.

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:23.960
Why don't you use this chance and find out 
if the prince has that <i>thing</i> on him for me?

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:26.920
If you find it, I'll be able to go in 
and out of the palace as I please.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:31.020
Which means I'll be able to help 
you with whatever you want.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:32.940
<i><i>Makes sense.</i></i>

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:36.710
Nothing good ever happens 
when I go somewhere with you,

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:37.960
but I'll go with you this time.

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:40.390
Thank you for your consideration, Highness.

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:42.800
What do you want me to do here?

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:47.390
The Hall of Esteemed Virtue

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:46.340
His Highness has ordered that, 
starting from today,

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:49.630
you will be responsible for all the day-to-day
running of the Hall of Esteemed Virtue.

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:51.270
The day-to-day running?

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:53.270
Here is the water tank.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.770
Please fill it with water, Your Highness.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.380
Are you short of laborers in the palace?

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:00.100
Why are you suddenly asking me to do this?

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.590
I do not dare to speculate on the 
reasons behind the prince's orders.

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:05.850
I am simply following them 
in bringing you here.

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:08.960
Chop wood and carry water?
Are these the prince's orders?

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.220
Take me to him.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:13.180
I will ask him what his 
intentions are in person.

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:17.300
Your Highness, please do not go to the prince.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:20.100
Will angering the prince again 
not make things worse?

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:23.050
These are tasks I am used to performing.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.970
I can easily do them by myself.

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:26.990
No way.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.100
How can I let you do it alone? I'll help.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.100
My lady! How could I allow 
you to perform these labors?

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:47.470
Hold on a minute. Let me see 
if there's some better solution.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:50.300
A better solution?

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:04.470
My lady! What are you planning to do?!

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:06.720
You'll see soon enough.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:13.390
Out of interest, Sister Jiao'er,

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:16.870
has the prince come to your place lately?

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:21.270
Not recently, but His Highness 
did send someone to greet me.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.600
His Highness is busy with his work.
We need to be understanding.

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:28.190
Oh my. How envious we are of you.

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:30.710
Do not speak of sending greetings.

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:33.140
We have not even heard 
from His Highness all year.

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.630
Worry not, sisters.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:42.520
I will be sure to relate your lovesickness 
to His Highness when I see him next.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:47.100
<i><i>I do not wish to grow old and die 
alone in this palace like these hags.</i></i>

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:48.520
Mistress.

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:50.770
I have news for you.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:59.000
Sisters, we have an entertaining 
spectacle awaiting us.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.140
An entertaining spectacle? What spectacle?

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:05.500
Follow me and you will find out.

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:08.840
I am certain you will all enjoy what you see.

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:19.640
You are amazing, my lady.
This is a much better solution.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.390
'Course it is. Who d'ya think you're talking to?

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:23.950
Oh my!

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.770
Why does my sister look so 
happy about chopping wood?

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:30.090
Oh me, oh my, I feel sorry for you.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:32.310
Indeed.

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:36.070
How can my sister be made 
to do such menial chores?

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:39.560
When I visit His Highness, 
I will be sure to plead your case.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.180
Plead my case? Who are you?

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:46.880
Busy nobles cannot be expected
 to remember everything,

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:49.180
but have you forgotten your 
sister after only a few days?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.600
My lady, have you forgotten?

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:58.770
Oh! You're Beauty Chu, right? The one who's 
always getting slapped and bruises easily?

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:01.460
I wish I was so bold.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.600
Well said!

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.850
What are <i>you</i> laughing at?! Stop laughing!

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:09.350
What are you doing?

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:12.300
You don't need to worry about me.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:20.730
Prince Ye is cruel. I suggest you stay away 
from him to avoid getting slapped again.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:24.710
Not only do you mock me, 
you also dare to traduce His Highness!

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:25.720
You are impudent!

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:28.020
It was just a friendly reminder.

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:30.140
Enough false sincerity!

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:32.470
What is this?

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:37.620
Oh my! Is this not the bamboo 
that was purchased a few days ago?

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:42.000
Indeed. This is the bamboo 
you spent a lot of money on.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.390
Why would she cut down such good bamboo?

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:47.150
Look at what you have done!

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:52.140
I made this so I don't have to 
carry water back and forth.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:58.420
Do you not realize that every single thing in 
this palace has been carefully placed by me?

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:00.020
You need my permission to touch them!

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.770
Well, I already did it. Is there 
a point to telling me this now?

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:08.340
Last time, you outlawed flower hairpins.
Now, cutting down bamboo is out.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:10.890
Do you own everything in this palace?

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:16.290
The palace belongs to the prince. But the 
prince allows me to oversee everything.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.640
As such, even the grass and 
trees are my responsibility.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:20.920
Prince Ye has such bad taste.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.720
Who is talking about me?

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.710
His Highness is here.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.270
Your Highness, please get justice for me.

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:35.210
Look, Your Highness. I scrimped and 
saved to buy these precious bamboo trees.

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:37.020
But the princess has cut them down!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.000
I asked her why she did,

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:47.450
and she said I was not good 
enough to oversee the palace.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:50.640
She also said Your Highness had 
terrible taste in choosing me to manage it.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.640
Please get justice for me, Your Highness.

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:58.390
<i><i>Let us see how the prince punishes you.</i></i>

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:00.630
If that is how the princess feels,

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:04.830
perhaps the princess should start 
managing the palace from tomorrow.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.390
I would like to see how 
capable the princess is.

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:10.890
What?!

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:12.310
Oh my.

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:16.300
Did His Highness just say the princess 
is to manage the palace now?

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:17.360
I believe so.

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:21.550
Your... Your Highness, I can 
handle managing the palace.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:25.720
I was merely pointing out that the 
princess should not doubt your taste.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.470
I did not say you cannot manage.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:34.220
It was the princess who said you could not.

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:38.910
So I would like know if I do,
 in fact, have terrible taste,

00:08:39.690 --> 00:08:41.470
or if it was merely an insult.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:44.600
But Your Highness, I am really...

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:48.970
Where did you get the courage 
to talk back to me again and again?

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:51.900
Hold it!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:55.100
I don't want to manage any palace.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:58.050
Oh? Well, this is most odd.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.940
Did you not say I had terrible taste?

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:04.590
You having terrible taste doesn't 
mean <i>I</i> want to manage the palace.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:07.800
It's hard work and a pain in the butt.
I'm not remotely interested.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:13.850
All right, then. Beauty Chu will continue
managing the daily affairs of the palace.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.850
Your Highness, I shall work harder 
and manage the palace even better!

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:24.300
From tomorrow hence, the princess will 
serve me in the Hall of Esteemed Virtue.

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:28.880
Stop making things hard for me.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.130
Didn't the emperor give me a 1,000 tael reward?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:32.850
Go use it to hire someone.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:35.130
I do not need to hire anyone.

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:38.350
However, I refuse to support idle wastrels.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:40.380
Who needs your support?

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.720
I support myself in the Serenity Pavilion.

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.920
The Serenity Pavilion is part of my palace.

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:46.380
You are my princess.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.810
It is your duty to serve me.

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:53.290
You didn't make me do it before!
Why are you changing your mind now?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.600
Because you do not wish to do it.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:10:00.000
Which makes me <i>want</i> you to do it.

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:10.850
<i>This woman constantly talks 
back to His Highness. Why is he...</i>

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:14.750
Take heed: from tomorrow,

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:18.110
if the princess defies my orders,
she will be disciplined.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:19.330
Yes, Highness.

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:20.910
You...

00:10:21.340 --> 00:10:22.220
Farewell, Highness.

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:25.450
Farewell, Your Highness.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.790
Damn that jerk.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.350
As soon as Auntie Xue is back, I'm outta here.

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:34.470
My lady, let us go back.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:44.850
Fortunately, your palace responsibilities
 were not taken from you. Close call, hm?

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:48.500
Sister, why are you shaking?

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:49.950
Are you all right?

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:57.220
That harlot <i>infuriates</i> me!

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:01.720
I, Chu Jiao'er, will <i>never</i> forgive you!

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:07.090
<i><i>We were keeping a nice distance 
from each other before. </i></i>

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:09.790
<i><i>Why'd this jerk suddenly ask me to serve him?</i></i>

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:11.840
<i><i>Let me pull out all your hair!</i></i>

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:15.500
Finished.

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:17.850
I'm done, so can I leave now?

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.510
No, you cannot leave yet.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.340
Why not?

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:27.140
Go sweep the courtyard. Then you may leave.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.220
Sweep the courtyard?

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:30.890
That wasn't the deal!

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:35.140
You will do whatever I want you to do.
We have no "deal" to speak of.

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:41.640
You're going back on your word!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:51.710
If I'd known you'd also be roped into this,

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:55.820
I would've pulled out some of 
his hair to teach him a lesson!

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:59.890
My lady, you cannot do that.
The prince will punish you.

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:03.050
As if I care about that.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:06.450
If I start fearing him, it'll just 
encourage him to push his luck, right?

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:14.270
Why are all these leaves suddenly falling?

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:22.640
<i><i>There is no wind, and the petioles are fresh. </i></i>

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:23.890
<i><i>Which means...</i></i>

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:27.730
You did this, right?

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:30.270
You... You can see me?

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:32.880
Teasing others like that...
Of course I can see you.

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:34.390
Take back your leaves.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:39.490
You think just because you can see me,
 you can order me around?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.150
Who did that?!

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:45.660
Me.

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:47.380
M-Mei! Why are you here?

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:49.260
Did you come to visit me?

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:58.330
Oh, it's you! What brings you here?

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:01.660
I came to take care of some business,
so I dropped in to see you.

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:03.140
Aren't I welcome?

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:05.580
You're always welcome!

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:08.520
Thanks for your help before. I've been 
looking for you so I could thank you.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:10.180
You're welcome!

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:12.670
My lady, who are you talking to?

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:14.540
The flower fairy who helped me last time.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:16.750
It is a shame I cannot see you...

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:19.060
My name is Que'er. Nice to meet you!

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:22.820
Mei...

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.930
By the way, why are you holding a broom?

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:29.430
You mean this thing? I have 
to sweep the courtyard today.

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:31.500
I'm here now, so leave it to—

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:32.920
Let me! Let me do it!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:36.130
I'm Muqing, a tree fairy.
Sorry for being a pain earlier.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:39.430
I will help you tidy up this 
whole courtyard right this second!

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:54.120
The seal was...

00:13:58.940 --> 00:13:59.680
This is...

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.390
You are...

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:24.340
I am this ginkgo tree and I have 
been asleep for many years.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.490
Did you wake me?

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:29.180
You're this ginkgo tree, huh?

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.600
Why'd you fall asleep?

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:35.940
That is rather a long story.

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:43.020
He just woke up from the seal,
so he might take a while to recover.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:46.600
Yeah, true. It's great he woke up, though.

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:49.100
This place is going to become livelier.

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:58.860
Why is this dead ginkgo tree now in full leaf?

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.350
It is extremely odd.

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:05.800
It is said that no grass will grow around 
this tree in the Serenity Pavilion...

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.100
Th-This is too spooky.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:08.320
We should go.

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:16.770
The investigation?

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.350
Your Highness.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.770
Another daughter appeared in the House
 of Grand Councilor three months ago.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.980
Three months ago, you say?

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:27.150
Are you certain?

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:28.740
Yes, Highness.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.590
Only one young lady 
resided there previously.

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:34.300
The other daughter has been 
considered a jinx since childhood.

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:39.180
She was raised on Spirit Cloud Mountain.
For some reason, she returned three months ago.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:44.480
How dare the House of Grand 
Councilor do this, Shadow...

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:46.960
They deceived His Imperial Majesty.

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:50.750
If this is true, their entire
house will be beheaded.

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:53.180
We must be sure. Check again.

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:56.060
Yes, Your Highness.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:15:58.350
What?

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:00.390
Is what you say true?

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:02.480
It is true, mistress.

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:05.930
There is an additional swing on
 this tree also. It is frightful indeed!

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:11.220
Although I have not been in the palace long, 
I have heard of this old dead ginkgo tree.

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:15.840
How did it come back to life 
overnight, lush and in full leaf?

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:19.430
Mistress, do you wish to 
report this to His Highness?

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:20.700
Not right now.

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:22.880
And the Taoist I asked you to invite?

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:25.380
The Chief Taoist is out of town.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.200
He will return in a few days.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:29.760
Excellent.

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:34.390
This time, come what may, I <i>will</i> make 
that woman show her true colors!
